data
table customer(name)

[Checkout]
table order(customer -> customer, state)

Ana checks out
  + customer c1  name: Ana
  + order o1     customer: c1 | state: pending

table payment(order -> order, state)

[Billing / S3]
folder invoices(order -> order)

Her payment is captured
  + payment p1          order: o1 | state: captured
  + invoices 2026/o1.pdf  order: o1
